<#@ import namespace="System.Linq" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common.Templates" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Metadata.Models" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modelers.Services.CQRS.Api" #>
<#@ import namespace="Aryzac.GitHubIssues.Api" #>
---
id: <#= Model.Id #>
title: "task(query): Add <#= Model.Name #> query handler"
type: task
<# if (Model.HasGitHubIssueClosed()) { #>
closed: true
<# } else { #>
closed: false
<# } #>
---
<# if (Model.HasBusinessRequirement()) { #>

### Business Goal

<#= Model.GetBusinessRequirement().Summary() #>
<# if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Comment)) { #>

<#= Model.Comment #>
<# } } #>

### Scope & Notes

| Property | Type | Nullable | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
<# foreach (var property in Model.Properties) { #>
| <#= property.Name #> | <#= property.TypeReference.Element.Name #> <#= property.TypeReference.IsCollection ? "[]" : "" #> | <#= property.TypeReference.IsNullable ? "Yes" : "No" #> | <#= string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(property.Comment) ? "" : property.Comment #> |
<# } #>

Estimated Effort
Estimated Days: 0.5

| Task                                          | Target Hours      |
|-----------------------------------------------|-------------------|
| Define query + DTO                            | 0.5h              |
| Add validator (if required)                   | 0.25h             |
| Implement handler (projection + filters)      | 0.75h             |
| Tests (happy, not found, pagination/ordering) | 1.0h              |
| Documentation updates                         | 0.25h             |
| Buffer                                        | 0.25h             |
| Total Target Hours                            | 2.75h (≈ 0.5 day) |

Acceptance Checklist
- [ ] Query implements IRequest<<#= Model.Name #>> (+ IQuery if applicable)
- [ ] DTO defined and returned (no domain entity leakage)
- [ ] Handler uses repository IQueryable + ProjectTo + AsNoTracking
- [ ] NotFoundException thrown when entity missing
- [ ] Pagination/ordering/filters handled or N/A documented
- [ ] Tests cover happy path, not found, filter/pagination cases
- [ ] Documentation updated (this recipe referenced)
- [ ] Effort variance >20% captured in issue comments
